  "notes": "Read the Centers & Institutes list only. Some items (Framingham Heart Study, MAVERIC, National Center for PTSD, Providence/Boston Center for AIDS Research at Brown) link to sites outside BU; the list shows them as is. The page also points to a complete BU-wide list at https://www.bu.edu/research/our-research/centers-institutes/ which was not read. Left out because the directory already has them (12): Alzheimer’s Disease Research Center (target bu-adrc); Cancer Center (target bu-cancer-center); Center for Regenerative Medicine (CReM) (target bu-crem); Chronic Traumatic Encephalopathy Center (target bu-cte); Clinical & Translational Science Institute (target bu-ctsi); Evans Center for Interdisciplinary Biomedical Research (target bu-evans-ibr); Genome Science Institute (target bu-gsi); Hearing Research Center (target bu-hrc); National Emerging Infectious Diseases Laboratories (target bu-neidl); Pulmonary Center (target bu-pulmonary); Slone Epidemiology Center (target bu-slone); Whitaker Cardiovascular Institute (target bu-whitaker). Named on the pages but given no entry, because no lead or site of their own is shown (4): Biomedical Genetics; Clinical Addiction Research and Education (CARE) Unit; New England Centenarian Study; Preventive Medicine & Epidemiology."
